PySide6 6.12.0 on Haiku: HaikuPorts' pyside6-6.10.3.patchset (MIT,
haikuports/haikuports dev-python/pyside6) without its build_scripts/main.py
hunk for haikuporter's native builds, which no longer applies and which a
cross build doesn't use. New: Haiku as a target platform of shiboken's
clang parser (aarch64-unknown-haiku, no host headers), and the sysroot and
target passed to it when cross-compiling for Haiku.

Ported 2026, haiku-odroid-c2 port authors.

